{"seq":3,"slug":"tradein-quote-fail-handle","title":"估价不达标与放弃换新处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/tradein-quote-fail-handle","wordCount":2103,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"估价不达标与放弃换新处置\">估价不达标与放弃换新处置</h1><p>换新交易的失败率远高于普通交易，这是由它的结构决定的：交易成立的前提是一台尚未被检验的设备。用户自述与实检之间必然有差距，差距足够大时用户就会拒绝成交；即使差距不大，用户在等待期内也可能改变主意。这类失败不是异常，而是业务常态的一部分——一条成熟换新链路的失败路径应当与成功路径同样被设计，而不是留一堆悬挂订单等客服处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-失败的四种形态\">核心概念：失败的四种形态</h2><p>把失败拆成形态而不是一个笼统的「失败」，是因为不同形态的资金流向、资产流向、用户沟通完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  F[换新未完成] --&gt; A[实检价低于报价&lt;br/&gt;用户拒绝]&#10;  F --&gt; B[旧品未寄回&lt;br/&gt;超期]&#10;  F --&gt; C[旧品寄回但不符合条件&lt;br/&gt;拒收品类]&#10;  F --&gt; D[用户主动放弃&lt;br/&gt;等待期内取消]&#10;  A --&gt; A1[归还旧品 或 按实检价成交]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[补收挂账金额 或 取消订单]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[旧品回寄 或 到付退回]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[释放抵扣 或 取消订单]\">graph TD\n  F[换新未完成] --&gt; A[实检价低于报价&lt;br/&gt;用户拒绝]\n  F --&gt; B[旧品未寄回&lt;br/&gt;超期]\n  F --&gt; C[旧品寄回但不符合条件&lt;br/&gt;拒收品类]\n  F --&gt; D[用户主动放弃&lt;br/&gt;等待期内取消]\n  A --&gt; A1[归还旧品 或 按实检价成交]\n  B --&gt; B1[补收挂账金额 或 取消订单]\n  C --&gt; C1[旧品回寄 或 到付退回]\n  D --&gt; D1[释放抵扣 或 取消订单]</pre><p><strong>形态一：实检价低于报价且用户拒绝。</strong> 旧品已经在平台手上，用户认为下调不合理。处置是二选一：按实检价成交（用户接受下调），或原物返还（用户坚持拒绝）。返还的成本（运费、时间）本身是一个决策变量——当旧品残值低于返还运费时，平台常见的做法是告知用户「可选择放弃该设备，我们将免费环保处置」，但这必须是一个<strong>用户明示的选择</strong>，不能默认执行。</p>\n<p><strong>形态二：旧品未寄回且超期。</strong> 挂账的抵扣必须被补收或取消。这里的判据不是「到检台是否收到」而是「是否有承运方揽收记录」，理由已经在 <a href=\"tradein-credit-new-order\">换新抵扣与新品订单联动</a> 里说明——没有揽收记录才算用户违约。送达期限本身是条款里的硬约束，例如主流换新流程要求旧设备在用户收到新设备起 14 天内送达，且状态须与用户描述一致（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/trade-in\">Apple Trade In</a>）；期限一旦写成条款，系统的判据就必须与条款对齐，而不是与到检台的收货时间对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>形态三：旧品寄回但不符合回收条件。</strong> 例如设备被拆修到无法验机、或者属于禁止寄递的品类（含膨胀电池的设备、被列入失窃库的 IMEI）。这类必须在取件环节就前置拦截，而不是等寄到验机台才发现，拦截设计属于 <a href=\"../tradein-collect-logistics/tradein-pickup-pack-kit\">旧品上门取件与寄回包材</a> 的范围；本篇只处理已经被寄回后的处置。</p>\n<p><strong>形态四：用户在等待期内主动放弃。</strong> 这是最温和的形态，因为它不涉及资产转移，只需要正确地释放抵扣与取消/继续订单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>资产位置</th>\n<th>挂账处置</th>\n<th>用户沟通要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实检价低于报价</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>按接受/拒绝分支</td>\n<td>特征级差异明细（见置信度篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未寄回超期</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>补收或取消</td>\n<td>期限与揽收记录的判定标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不符合回收条件</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>按残值折价或退回</td>\n<td>拒收原因与退回方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户主动放弃</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>释放</td>\n<td>订单是否继续生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"差异幅度的分级处置\">差异幅度的分级处置</h2><p>并非所有差异都值得走同一条流程。按「实检价 / 报价」的比值（记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>）分级，能让大部分小额差异自动闭合，只把大额争议交给人工。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 区间</th>\n<th>差异性质</th>\n<th>处置策略</th>\n<th>谁决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ge 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>微差</td>\n<td>自动接受，按实检价结算并告知</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.70</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.70 \\le r &lt; 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>常规差异</td>\n<td>用户确认或拒绝</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.40</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.40 \\le r &lt; 0.70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大额差异</td>\n<td>用户确认 + 复核通道开放</td>\n<td>用户 + 复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &lt; 0.40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极端差异</td>\n<td>强制复核，暂停自动结算</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ge 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span> 的自动接受阈值是一个必须在报价页预告的规则：报价时用户已经看到「约 N% 的订单不会下调」的提示（见 <a href=\"../used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust\">估价置信度与到检调整</a>），自动接受只是把这个承诺兑现，它不构成意外。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &lt; 0.40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span></span></span></span></span> 走强制复核的理由是：极端差异更可能来自验机错误或用户对设备状态的根本性误判（例如用户不知道设备已被锁定为丢失状态），而不是正常磨损。这类情形直接按实检价结算会引发严重投诉，人工介入的成本低于投诉成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def classify_regrade_delta(quote_price, real_price):&#10;    r = real_price / max(quote_price, 1)&#10;    if r &gt;= 0.95:&#10;        return {&quot;band&quot;: &quot;auto_accept&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;settle_at_real&quot;}&#10;    if r &gt;= 0.70:&#10;        return {&quot;band&quot;: &quot;user_confirm&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;await_user_choice&quot;}&#10;    if r &gt;= 0.40:&#10;        return {&quot;band&quot;: &quot;user_confirm_with_review&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;await_user_choice&quot;,&#10;                &quot;review_available&quot;: True}&#10;    return {&quot;band&quot;: &quot;mandatory_review&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;suspend_auto_settlement&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify_regrade_delta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quote_price, real_price):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> real_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quote_price, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto_accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settle_at_real\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_confirm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"await_user_choice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_confirm_with_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"await_user_choice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"review_available\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mandatory_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspend_auto_settlement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"用户放弃换新时的订单处置\">用户放弃换新时的订单处置</h2><p>用户放弃换新并不必然意味着放弃购买新机。这是一个经常被混淆的地方：<strong>取消换新</strong>与<strong>取消订单</strong>是两件事。用户可能仍然想要新手机，只是不想折腾旧手机了。此时订单应当从「换新订单」降级为「普通订单」，抵扣挂账被释放，用户补付原来被抵扣覆盖的那部分现金。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 取消换新：释放抵扣挂账，重算订单应付现金&#10;BEGIN;&#10;&#10;UPDATE tradein_credit_ledger&#10;SET entry_type = &#39;RELEASED&#39;&#10;WHERE order_id = :order_id AND entry_type = &#39;PENDING&#39;;&#10;&#10;UPDATE orders o&#10;SET payable_cents = o.payable_cents&#10;      + COALESCE((&#10;          SELECT SUM(amount_cents) FROM tradein_credit_ledger&#10;          WHERE order_id = :order_id AND entry_type = &#39;RELEASED&#39;&#10;        ), 0),&#10;    is_tradein = false,&#10;    updated_at = now()&#10;WHERE o.order_id = :order_id;&#10;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取消换新：释放抵扣挂账，重算订单应付现金</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_credit_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payable_cents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payable_cents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_cents) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_credit_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    is_tradein </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段事务的关键在于<strong>先释放再重算</strong>，且重算金额直接从账本聚合而不是从订单上的旧字段加减。从账本聚合是幂等的：重复执行只会得到一个稳定的结果（已释放的条目不会再被释放，因为 <code>WHERE entry_type = &#39;PENDING&#39;</code>），而从字段加减在重试时会重复加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补付的时序与失败\">补付的时序与失败</h3><p>降级后的补付如果失败（用户拒付），订单应当进入待取消状态而不是自动取消——用户可能只是支付方式有问题。自动取消会连带触发新品的物流回退，成本远高于等待一次重试。这条规则的落地方式是给订单一个 <code>awaiting_topup</code> 状态与一个显式的超时窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"未寄回的补收与征信边界\">未寄回的补收与征信边界</h2><p>未寄回超期后的补收是整条链路上最敏感的动作，因为它涉及向用户追收款项。设计上有三条硬边界。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>补收金额不得超过挂账金额</strong>。挂账金额是用户在报价页上看到并同意的数字，超出这个数字的任何罚金都缺乏事前同意基础。第二，<strong>必须在超期前有明确提醒</strong>。提醒的次数与时点应当留痕，因为它是「平台已尽告知义务」的证据。第三，<strong>必须有不可归责于用户的豁免条件</strong>：有揽收记录但未到检的、因不可抗力无法寄出的、设备在运输中损坏的，都应豁免补收并转由运输保障承担。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: 88291,&#10;  &quot;expiry_case&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;deadline_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-12T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reminders_sent&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-05T09:00:00Z&quot;, &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;email&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-10T09:00:00Z&quot;, &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;push&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;carrier_pickup_record&quot;: null,&#10;    &quot;charge_back_cents&quot;: 33106,&#10;    &quot;waiver_check&quot;: [&quot;force_majeure&quot;, &quot;carrier_damage&quot;, &quot;pickup_record&quot;],&#10;    &quot;waiver_result&quot;: false&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88291</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expiry_case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deadline_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reminders_sent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-05T09:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-10T09:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"push\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"carrier_pickup_record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"charge_back_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">33106</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"waiver_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"force_majeure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier_damage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pickup_record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"waiver_result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>waiver_check</code> 里的三项是必须逐项判定的豁免条件。把豁免做成一个显式列表而不是散落的 if 分支，可以让「这笔补收为什么成立」在事后可审计——尤其在跨境场景下，不同法域对消费者追收的要求差异很大，豁免规则的集合也需要按市场配置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"失窃设备与拒收品类\">失窃设备与拒收品类</h3><p>有一类特殊的失败是设备本身不能进入回收链：被列入失窃库的设备（通过 IMEI 黑名单核验）或属于法规禁止跨境转移的危险品类。这类设备不能在平台留存，也不应被用户重新寄出，正确处理是拒绝接收并原物退回（或按当地法规引导至合规回收点）。识别应当在报价阶段就发生，而不是到检阶段——让用户白寄一趟是最差的体验，也会产生无谓的跨境运输单据。识别所需的数据源与校验方式属于 <a href=\"../tradein-collect-logistics/tradein-pickup-pack-kit\">旧品上门取件与寄回包材</a> 的前置校验部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>换新失败是业务常态，四种形态（实检低于报价、未寄回、不符合回收条件、主动放弃）的资金与资产流向各不相同，必须分别设计。</li>\n<li>按实检价/报价比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 分级处置：微差自动接受、常规差异用户确认、大额开放复核、极端强制复核。</li>\n<li>「取消换新」与「取消订单」是两件事；取消换新后订单降级为普通订单，从账本聚合重算应付金额以保证幂等。</li>\n<li>未寄回补收有三条硬边界：不超挂账、超期前留痕提醒、显式豁免列表（揽收记录/不可抗力/运输损坏）。</li>\n<li>失窃设备与禁运品类的识别必须在报价阶段前置，避免用户白寄产生跨境运输单据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"估价不达标与放弃换新处置","id":"估价不达标与放弃换新处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：失败的四种形态","id":"核心概念-失败的四种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"差异幅度的分级处置","id":"差异幅度的分级处置"},{"level":2,"text":"用户放弃换新时的订单处置","id":"用户放弃换新时的订单处置"},{"level":3,"text":"补付的时序与失败","id":"补付的时序与失败"},{"level":2,"text":"未寄回的补收与征信边界","id":"未寄回的补收与征信边界"},{"level":3,"text":"失窃设备与拒收品类","id":"失窃设备与拒收品类"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平台与品牌换新补贴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/platform-subsidy-tradein"},"next":{"title":"旧品上门取件与寄回包材","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/tradein-pickup-pack-kit"}}